cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MDPI Review Suite in your research, academic work, teaching, or scientific publications, please cite this software."
type: software

title: "MDPI Review Suite"
short-title: "MDPI"
version: "1.0.0"

abstract: >
  MDPI Review Suite is a collection of specialized AI-agent skills for
  reviewing academic papers against the MDPI journal rubric and the official
  MDPI peer-review form. It supports pre-submission dry-runs, actual reviews,
  and rebuttal preparation for MDPI journals.

authors:
